IGEL_SURFACE_WLAN_IMPROVEMENTS
	  Change some things in the mwifiex driver to improve the stability and
	  the performance of the WLAN in surface devices and possible others too.

	  Source: linux-surface
	  URL: https://github.com/linux-surface/linux-surface/tree/master/patches
